# MEXO — Metaheuristic Experiment Ontology
#
# Persistent namespace:
# https://w3id.org/mexo/
#
# Redirect target:
# https://github.com/SYNAPSE-RG/MEXO-Ont
#
# This W3ID namespace provides persistent identifiers for the MEXO ontology.
#
# Primary maintainer:
#   GitHub username: @Julio-Noe
#   GitHub profile:  https://github.com/Julio-Noe
#
# Maintainer:
# SYNAPSE Research Group
# GitHub organization: SYNAPSE-RG
# https://github.com/SYNAPSE-RG
#
# Repository:
# https://github.com/SYNAPSE-RG/MEXO-Ont

RewriteEngine On

# Redirect the MEXO namespace root to the published documentation.
RewriteRule ^$ https://synapse-rg.github.io/MEXO-Ont/ [R=303,L]

# Redirect requests for MEXO terms and subpaths to the published documentation.
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://synapse-rg.github.io/MEXO-Ont/$1 [R=303,L]